	"data": "ThoughtBubbles — A Spatial Knowledge Environment\n\nThe definitive guide to the concept, its history, architecture, and future. Written for anyone encountering ThoughtBubbles for the first time — collaborators, professors, partners, and the curious.\n\nWhat Is ThoughtBubbles?\n\nThoughtBubbles is a concept for spatial knowledge organization — a system that renders your thoughts, memories, ideas, and goals as navigable 3D structures in extended reality (XR).\n\nImagine stepping inside your own mind.…",
